# iOS / local Vite: cloud-connect against the PROD Portal on purpose — core-3,
# the account the device-connect flow is exercised with, lives on hub.ci.computer
# and not on the dev Portal. Keep this explicit rather than relying on the
# fallback: this file is loaded only for `mode === 'development'`, so a
# store-bound `vite build` never sees it.
#
# To point local dev at the CI cloud *dev* Portal instead, either set this to
# https://hub.companionintelligence.com or replace it with
# VITE_CI_HUB_ENVIRONMENT=development. Deleting the line now leaves you on
# production too — see the resolution order documented in
# src/pages/DeviceConnectPage/portal-client.ts.
VITE_CI_CLOUD_URL=https://hub.ci.computer
